resh, vaginal dryness meant pain, irritation, and even occasional bleeding during sex. Since starting FloraFresh, my natural lubrication has soared in just a couple of weeks—no more pain or bleeding! Intercourse is enjoyable again, and I’m so relieved!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg80foD8eW9_text","label":"gg80foD8eW9_text","default":"<p>Ellie H.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLi6BGh1_t_text","label":"ggLi6BGh1_t_text","default":"Verified buyer"},{"type":"html","id":"ggr_5oZrrOQ_label","label":"ggr_5oZrrOQ_label","default":"<p>Try FloraFresh Now!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gwpdmMKsubLaI_text","label":"gwpdmMKsubLaI_text","default":"<p>90-Day Money-back Guarantee</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gpubOZkHVclLg_text","label":"gpubOZkHVclLg_text","default":"<p>Struggling With Relentless Vaginal Infections? Plagued by Strange Discharge or Stubborn Odor? <span style=\"color:#EE2E8D;\">Discover the Shocking Truth Lurking Down Below!</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gjutyetiERQwe_text","label":"gjutyetiERQwe_text","default":"<p>Your vaginal health relies on a delicate balance that modern life constantly disrupts.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPWX5sY6PI_text","label":"ggPWX5sY6PI_text","default":"<p>Antibiotics, birth control, and harsh hygiene products don't just clean - they destroy the beneficial Lactobacillus bacteria that protect you from Candida yeast overgrowth.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpB3NPleQ__text","label":"ggpB3NPleQ__text","default":"<p><strong>The result?</strong> A frustrating cycle of bacterial vaginosis, yeast infections, and UTIs that keep returning no matter what you try. The itching, discharge, and embarrassing odor aren't just uncomfortable - they signal your body's natural defenses have been compromised.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQ8h7rE2cd_text","label":"ggQ8h7rE2cd_text","default":"<p>FloraFresh addresses the root cause by restoring your natural bacterial balance, creating an environment where infections can't thrive. Break free from recurring infections and reclaim your comfort and confidence.</p>"}],
